fullName":"Rep. Houlahan, Chrissy [D-PA-6]","party":"D","state":"PA"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-06-12","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Military Access to Reproductive Care and Health for Military Servicemembers Act or the MARCH for Military Servicemembers Act</strong></p><p>This bill allows Department of Defense (DOD) funds and facilities to be used to perform abortions without restrictions on the reason.&nbsp;Currently, DOD funds and facilities may only be used to perform abortions if the abortion is due to rape, incest, or endangerment of the mother.</p>","updateDate":"2026-03-18T21:11:34Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"MARCH for Military Servicemembers Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-07-14T08:07:02Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-14T08:07:02Z"}
